Affiliate payout request #{{ payout_id }}
<p>Affiliate #{{ affiliate_id }} ({{ account_name }}) requested a payout of <strong>{{ amount }}</strong>.</p>
<p>The transfer details are in the admin area, under Clients, Affiliates, Payouts{% if portal_url %}: <a href="{{ portal_url }}/admin/afiliados/retiros">{{ portal_url }}/admin/afiliados/retiros</a>{% endif %}. Once transferred, mark it paid with the reference or reject it with the reason.</p>
